  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9bAr2oL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"949\" height=\"251\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252ffTzK9SP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/648382392230215702?color=208fc6&label= &labelColor=1b74b6&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord\" width=\"145\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ItsBlackGear\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsBlackGear&color=208fc6&labelColor=1b74b6&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=DDE4EF\" alt=\"\" width=\"157\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/blackgear\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?label=&color=208fc6&labelColor=1b74b6&style=for-the-badge&logo=Patreon&logoColor=white&url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api/?username=blackgear&type=patrons\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6H8YGoX.png\" width=\"1131\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Fabric / Quilt 需求</strong></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">您需要 Fabric API</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires_Fabric_API-white?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=1b74b6&color=208fc6\" alt=\"\" width=\"176\" height=\"28\"></a></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6H8YGoX.png\" width=\"1131\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">🚀 <strong>Platform</strong> 是一款基於 Architectury 的跨平台程式庫模組，旨在同時提供對 Forge 與 Fabric API 的存取功能。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><strong>功能特色：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">模組實體建構器</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">內建註冊表建構器</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">生物羣系修改與放置註冊表。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">簡易原版整合工具。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">創造模式標籤頁的建立與修改。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">豐富的實用工具類別！\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">註冊表</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">粒子效果</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">木材類型</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">村民交易</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">網路通訊</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">設定檔</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">事件</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">更多功能即將推出！</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>支援的模組：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rotten-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">RottenCreatures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/offlimits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Offlimits</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cavebiomeapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CaveBiomeAPI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6H8YGoX.png\" width=\"1131\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fminecraft-servers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H8ftf1K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1131\" height=\"283\"></a></p>",
